### 1. Health & Root Info
GET {{Host}}/health
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{Host}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Payments — Authorize Payment (Merchant Role)
# @name authorizePayment
POST {{Host}}/api/v1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{MerchantToken}}
Idempotency-Key: idemp-http-test-001
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "partyId": "merch_acme",
  "amount": 10000,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "settlementChannel": "adyen-wiremock"
}

### 3. Payments — Get Payment Details
@paymentId = {{authorizePayment.response.body.paymentId}}
GET {{Host}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{MerchantToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Payments — Capture Payment (Partial or Full)
POST {{Host}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/capture
Authorization: Bearer {{MerchantToken}}
Idempotency-Key: idemp-capture-001
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "amount": 5000
}

### 5. Payments — Refund Payment
POST {{Host}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{MerchantToken}}
Idempotency-Key: idemp-refund-001
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "amount": 2000
}

### 6. Payments — Cancel Payment
POST {{Host}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{MerchantToken}}
Idempotency-Key: idemp-cancel-001
Accept: application/json

### 7. Operations — Query Unresolved Payments (Ops Role)
GET {{Host}}/api/v1/payments/unresolved?channel=adyen-wiremock&ageMinutes=0&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{OpsToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Webhooks — Register Merchant Webhook Subscription
POST {{Host}}/api/v1/webhooks/merchants/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{MerchantToken}}
Idempotency-Key: idemp-webhook-sub-001
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "callbackUrl": "https://api.acme-store.com/webhooks/payments",
  "eventTypes": [
    "payment.authorized",
    "payment.settled",
    "payment.failed"
  ]
}

### 9. Risk — List Flagged Payments (Risk Role)
GET {{Host}}/api/v1/risk/flags?status=Flagged&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{RiskToken}}
Accept: application/json
